# Files uploaded by `gcloud builds submit`. Without this file gcloud falls back to .gitignore,
# which would drop .env and break the image build. .env is uploaded on purpose: it is baked
# into the image, and its copy also lands in the Cloud Build source bucket.
*
!runner/
!runner/**
!config/
!config/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!pyproject.toml
!requirements-dev.txt
!cloudbuild.yaml
!.env
**/__pycache__/
